astral-perf-hud.patch provenance

The HUD statistics, host probes, rasteriser, Vulkan copy, dump compositing, the
hand-over to Apple's Metal HUD and MangoHud (both used, not included) and
tests are original work. The patch carries context from the pinned public
runtime (SuperMarioWonderRecomp at 010ed7a596a621c15d3a8dfa5795ca8c3668b066).

runtime/src/font8x8_basic.h (added by the patch) holds the printable ASCII
rows (U+0020..U+007E) of font8x8_basic.h from
https://github.com/dhepper/font8x8, reformatted into a C++ constant table:

  8x8 monochrome bitmap fonts for rendering
  Author: Daniel Hepper <daniel@hepper.net>
  License: Public Domain

  Based on:
  // Summary: font8x8.h
  // 8x8 monochrome bitmap fonts for rendering
  //
  // Author:
  //     Marcel Sondaar
  //     International Business Machines (public domain VGA fonts)
  //
  // License:
  //     Public Domain

The glyph data is in the public domain. No other third-party code is used.
